 * { exert: true }
 * ```
 *
 * @example "{E}, 2 {I}" - exert and pay 2 ink
 * ```typescript
 * { exert: true, ink: 2 }
 * ```
 *
 * @example "{E}, Banish this item" - exert and banish self
 * ```typescript
 * { exert: true, banishSelf: true }
 * ```
 *
 * @example "Choose and discard a card" - discard cost
 * ```typescript
